<item><title>Burundi intelligence agents arrest three Banyamulenge refugees in Bujumbura</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-intelligence-agents-arrest-three-banyamulenge-b3f3c2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-intelligence-agents-arrest-three-banyamulenge-b3f3c2/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Families say they have heard nothing about the men since their arrest on 20 November, and one was due to marry the next day.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:21:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" length="31311" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bi.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
